## Original Content
On Sept. 24 in New York City, Digiday, Glossy and Modern Retail will host the second iteration of AI Marketing Strategies, bringing together brand leaders, agency executives, analysts and technology providers to explore what’s actually working as AI reshapes modern marketing.

## Summary
The article announces the second iteration of the AI Marketing Strategies event, hosted by Digiday, Glossy, and Modern Retail in New York City on September 24. The event will gather brand leaders from Samsung, Bayer, David’s Bridal, and Dolce&Gabbana Beauty to explore how AI is reshaping modern marketing practices.

## Key Points
- The event is the second iteration of AI Marketing Strategies.
- Hosted by media companies Digiday, Glossy, and Modern Retail.
- Features brand leaders from Samsung, Bayer, David’s Bridal, and Dolce&Gabbana Beauty.
- Focuses on practical applications of AI in transforming modern marketing.


